ault\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Rigomar</span>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3355e11 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3355e11\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dee3dfa elementor-widget__width-initial sc-reveal elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dee3dfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Sviluppo sito web e shooting fotografico per Rigomar: una presenza digitale più autorevole per il mondo della produzione moda.</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b495ae elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1b495ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"1021\">Un progetto costruito per raccontare Rigomar in modo più chiaro, contemporaneo e credibile, attraverso strategia, sviluppo web e contenuti visuali dedicati.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6b6e2d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a6b6e2d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01b4eb2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"01b4eb2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Anno</span>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e4ef04f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e4ef04f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2024</span>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f2c2e9c nm-text-reveal e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f2c2e9c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;video&quot;,&quot;background_video_link&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/netmarket.it\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Rigomar-video.mp4&quot;,&quot;background_play_on_mobile&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-video-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<video class=\"elementor-background-video-hosted lazyload\" role=\"presentation\" autoplay muted playsinline loop></video>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad061f6 e-con-full nm-reveal-wrap e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ad061f6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e61d94a nm-text-reveal e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e61d94a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abd88ba e-con-full nm-reveal-wrap e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"abd88ba\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3d26fd nm-fade-text elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d3d26fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3624\">Rigomar aveva bisogno di una presenza digitale capace di raccontare meglio il proprio valore nel mondo della produzione moda conto terzi.</p><p data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3624\"> </p><p data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3937\">Netmarket ha sviluppato un progetto completo che ha unito strategia, sviluppo del nuovo sito istituzionale e shooting fotografico dedicato. Il lavoro ha permesso di chiarire il posizionamento dell’azienda, valorizzare i servizi e costruire un’immagine più contemporanea, autorevole e coerente con il target B2B.</p><p data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3937\"> </p><p data-start=\"3939\" data-end=\"4086\">Il risultato è un sito essenziale, premium e orientato al contatto, supportato da contenuti visuali pensati per rafforzare la percezione del brand.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97ca6a2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"97ca6a2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce67dad elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ce67dad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https://netmarket.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sviluppo-sito-web-rigomar--1024x576.webp\" data-srcset=\"https://netmarket.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sviluppo-sito-web-rigomar--1024x576.webp 1024w, https://netmarket.it/wp-content/uploads